WEBVTT

00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:07.161
In this video, you will fix a mistake in a home you added to your contest yourself, such as a misspelled family name.

00:00:07.161 --> 00:00:08.159
We start on the map.

00:00:09.129 --> 00:00:10.803
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:16.189
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:18.955
Then tap Allow.

00:00:23.149 --> 00:00:26.357
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:26.357 --> 00:00:29.139
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:33.702
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:33.702 --> 00:00:34.403
Tap it.

00:00:35.946 --> 00:00:37.905
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:39.511 --> 00:00:43.600
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.482
Tap Mine, your personal page.

00:00:47.036 --> 00:00:49.145
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:50.965 --> 00:00:52.159
Now tap Entries.

00:00:53.941 --> 00:00:55.725
Every home is a row.

00:00:55.725 --> 00:01:00.879
The homes you added yourself are tagged Added by organizer, and each one has an Edit button.

00:01:01.741 --> 00:01:03.556
Tap Edit on the home with the mistake.

00:01:05.435 --> 00:01:06.789
Fix the name here.

00:01:06.789 --> 00:01:09.556
A misspelled family name is the most common mistake.

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:13.746
You can also change the description, and the address.

00:01:13.746 --> 00:01:17.577
If you change the address, we look it up again, and move the pin on the map.

00:01:18.536 --> 00:01:19.381
Tap Save.

00:01:21.506 --> 00:01:25.879
The home is fixed everywhere, on the ballot, on the routes, and on the map.

00:01:25.879 --> 00:01:29.682
You can change a name or a description until the winners are announced.

00:01:29.682 --> 00:01:31.672
After that, the address is locked.

00:01:32.523 --> 00:01:34.854
That is how you fix a home you added.

00:01:34.854 --> 00:01:38.114
The Edit button is there for as long as the contest runs.

00:01:39.445 --> 00:01:42.622
Next up: Add photos to a home and send the owner a link.
